-- Canonical repo mirror for the isolated Vivit Group operating expansion.
-- Supabase was applied atomically in: hospitality_operating_expansion_v1,
-- tech_sales_delivery_expansion_v1, vgroup_operating_engines_v1,
-- hospitality_procurement_match_fix_v1, vgroup_operating_expansion_grant_hardening_v1,
-- vgroup_operating_expansion_fk_indexes_v1.
-- Marketing production is intentionally not referenced by this migration.

